# Preview-only secret for the bbm-portal prod stack (epic #13 / bbm-public-website#114).
#
# Copy to `deploy/.env.preview` ON THE HOST and fill in. Gitignored — lives only
# on the VPS. Kept SEPARATE from .env.prod so the preview container never receives
# the app's Payload/S3/seed secrets (least-privilege, same split as .env.postgres).
#
# This is the FULL `Authorization` header value the preview server sends to Payload
# verbatim — scheme included. For a Users API key the scheme is the collection slug:
#   PAYLOAD_PREVIEW_TOKEN=users API-Key <key>
# Issue the <key> in /admin: open your Users doc -> enable "API Key" -> copy the
# generated key (NOT the JWT login token). See deploy/README.md -> Preview service.
# PAYLOAD_API_URL is NOT here — it is a non-secret compose `environment` value
# (http://app:3000) in docker-compose.prod.yml.
PAYLOAD_PREVIEW_TOKEN=users API-Key replace-with-key
